            "value" : "传感器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With this on, the screen stays awake while charging. The floating monitor can continue sensor sampling after MiniWatts enters the background; a Live Activity alone cannot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开后会在充电时保持屏幕常亮。MiniWatts 进入后台后，悬浮监视器可继续维持传感器采样；仅开启实时活动无法做到这一点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With this on, the screen stays awake while charging. Live Activity and floating-monitor background refresh work independently of this setting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开后会在充电时保持屏幕常亮。实时活动和悬浮监视器的后台刷新不受此设置影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Serial" : {
