          }
        }
      }
    },
    "USB-C input" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "USB-C 输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "USB-C input current" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "USB-C 输入电流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "USB-C input voltage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "USB-C 输入电压"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used only for the %-rate estimate, which is the sole way to see discharge power: no discharge-current sensor is exposed to a sandboxed app. Look up your model's rating — an iPhone 17 Pro Max is about 19.7 Wh — and enter it here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅用于百分比变化率估算，这也是查看放电功率的唯一方式：沙盒应用无法访问任何放电电流传感器。请查询您机型的额定能量（例如 iPhone 17 Pro Max 约为 19.7 Wh）并在此输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "W rated" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "W 额定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warming up. Charge current may be trimmed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度上升中，充电电流可能会被削减。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "功率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Well under the adapter's rating while the system is thermally throttling — the ceiling right now is heat, not the charger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统正在因发热限频，功率远低于适配器额定值——此刻的瓶颈是温度，不是充电器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wired" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless charger" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless charging has no input-current sensor, so there is nothing to compare against the rating. The voltage and current below are the profile the pad negotiated — a ceiling that stays put while the actual draw moves." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电没有输入电流传感器，因此无法与额定功率进行对比。下方的电压与电流为充电板协商的供电规格 —— 仅作为固定上限，而实际功率则会动态变动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless charging is capped well below what the adapter could deliver over the cable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电的上限远低于同一适配器通过线缆能提供的功率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless coil" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电线圈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless input" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless input current" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线输入电流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless input voltage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线输入电压"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left side" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "左侧显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Right side" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "右侧显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Multiple activities" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "多活动时显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow right side" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跟随右侧设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status icon" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "状态图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report stays on this iPhone until you choose where to share it. It contains recent probe state and sensor names, but no serial number or account information." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "报告只会保留在这台 iPhone 上，直到你主动选择分享位置。报告包含最近的探针状态和传感器名称，但不包含序列号或账户信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SoC icon" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SoC 图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery temperature icon" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电池温度图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hottest temperature icon" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最高温度图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the compact Dynamic Island's left and right contents independently. For example, use status icon + power, or power + temperature. The right-side choice is also the primary readout when expanded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可分别选择灵动岛紧凑状态左右两侧的内容，例如“状态图标 + 功率”或“功率 + 温度”。右侧选择同时作为长按展开后的主要读数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning this on starts the Live Activity immediately. It refreshes while MiniWatts is open, or in the background while the floating monitor is running. A Live Activity by itself doesn't keep sensor sampling active." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开后会立即启动实时活动。MiniWatts 打开时会持续刷新；悬浮监视器运行时也可在后台刷新。仅开启实时活动本身无法维持传感器采样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning this on starts the Live Activity immediately. This personal build uses an ultra-low-frequency audio carrier to keep local sensor sampling alive after you leave the app. iOS can still stop the process, and removes every Dynamic Island Live Activity after eight hours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开后会立即启动实时活动。此自用版本通过超低频音频载波，让离开 App 后的本地传感器采样尽量保持运行；iOS 仍可能终止进程，并会在八小时后移除灵动岛实时活动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show live readings in the floating window" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在悬浮窗显示实时读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hidden carrier mode uses the system video-call Picture in Picture container. After it is parked at the screen edge, MiniWatts shrinks it to 0.1 pt so no PlayerLayer line remains." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏载体模式使用系统的视频通话画中画容器。停靠到屏幕边缘后，MiniWatts 会将其压缩到 0.1 pt，因此不会残留 PlayerLayer 的小细线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0.1 pt hidden Picture in Picture carrier" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "0.1 pt 隐藏画中画载体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide floating window to 0.1 pt" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将悬浮窗隐藏到 0.1 pt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore floating window" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复悬浮窗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When two or three activities share the Dynamic Island, MiniWatts shows one short reading chosen above. iOS decides its position; the left and right choices apply when MiniWatts is alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当两个或三个实时活动共用灵动岛时，MiniWatts 会显示这里选择的一项简短读数。显示位置由 iOS 决定；只有 MiniWatts 单独显示时，才使用上方的左右两侧设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relevance score (experimental)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "排序分数（实验性）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 · Current default" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 · 当前默认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 · Lower relevance" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "0 · 较低关联度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sends an update to the current Live Activity without restarting it. iOS decides the final position." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无需重启即可向当前实时活动发送更新；最终位置由 iOS 决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MiniWatts sends the new score to the current Live Activity immediately. Apple documents this score for ranking multiple activities from the same app; it does not guarantee a change in position next to other apps. When MiniWatts is alone, its display stays the same." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换后 MiniWatts 会立即向当前实时活动发送新分数。Apple 仅明确说明它用于同一 App 多个活动的排序；与其他 App 并存时不保证位置变化。仅有 MiniWatts 时，显示方式不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restart Live Activity" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新启动实时活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restarting Live Activity" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在重新启动实时活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activity could not be restarted. Keep MiniWatts open and try again. If this repeats, check Live Activities in iOS Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实时活动无法重新启动。请保持 MiniWatts 在前台并重试；如果反复出现，请检查 iOS 设置中的实时活动权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Picture in Picture before changing its hidden state." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先启动画中画，再更改隐藏状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop Picture in Picture before changing modes. Swipe the floating monitor to either screen edge when you want to park it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换模式前请先停止画中画。需要停靠时，将悬浮监视器滑向任一屏幕边缘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Picture in Picture, then swipe it to either screen edge. MiniWatts hides it automatically when iOS reports that it is parked; if iOS does not report that state, return here and tap Hide floating window to 0.1 pt. Open MiniWatts again to restore or stop it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先启动画中画，再将它滑向任一屏幕边缘。iOS 报告已停靠后，MiniWatts 会自动隐藏；如果 iOS 没有报告该状态，请返回这里点击“将悬浮窗隐藏到 0.1 pt”。再次打开 MiniWatts 可以恢复或停止画中画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activity" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实时活动"
