    "Hottest component" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最高部件温度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The compact Dynamic Island shows this reading. Press and hold it to see power, SoC, battery and hottest-component temperatures together." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "灵动岛紧凑状态显示此项读数。长按展开后可同时查看功率、SoC、电池和最高部件温度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning this on starts the Live Activity immediately. It stays visible across charger changes and keeps refreshing once per second in the background until you turn it off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开后会立即启动实时活动。无论是否连接充电器，它都会持续显示并在后台每秒刷新，直到你手动关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activities are disabled in iOS Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
