          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The floating monitor is hidden. Monitoring and Dynamic Island updates are still running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "悬浮监视器已隐藏；监测和灵动岛更新仍在继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe Picture in Picture to either screen edge to park it. MiniWatts hides the standard playback controls; iOS handles docking and decides whether the restore indicator fades after the window is idle." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将画中画滑向任一屏幕边缘即可停靠。MiniWatts 会隐藏标准播放控件；停靠动作以及静置后恢复指示是否淡出均由 iOS 决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe Picture in Picture to either screen edge to park it. The remaining arrow is the system PiP restore control and cannot be removed by the app; MiniWatts leaves the system window untouched so the app, video stream and Dynamic Island remain stable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将画中画滑向任一屏幕边缘即可停靠。留下的箭头是系统画中画恢复入口，App 无法移除；MiniWatts 不再修改系统窗口，以保证 App、视频流和灵动岛稳定运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Picture in Picture preview" : {
